---
import Base from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import policies from '../../content/pages/policies.json';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Naya Aasha" description="How Naya Aasha handles personal information, privacy choices, and website analytics.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy</p><p class="eyebrow">Policy</p><h1 class="display">{policies.privacyTitle}</h1></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="narrow prose">
    <p>{policies.privacyText}</p>
    <h2>Information you provide</h2>
    <p>We may receive contact details and information that you voluntarily submit through enquiries, volunteer applications, partnership discussions, or support requests. Please do not submit private medical records through the website.</p>
    <h2>Privacy choices and local storage</h2>
    <p>The website stores your language and analytics choice in your browser so it can remember your preference. This necessary browser storage is not used for advertising. You can change your choice at any time using “Cookie settings” in the footer.</p>
    <h2>Optional website analytics</h2>
    <p>If you accept analytics, we use Vercel Web Analytics and Google Analytics 4 to understand page visits, referring pages, approximate country or region, browser, operating system, and device type. These services are not loaded until you accept analytics. Google Analytics may set cookies such as <code>_ga</code> and process request and device information. We disable Google advertising storage, advertising personalization, and Google Signals in the website configuration.</p>
    <p>Vercel uses a temporary request-derived hash for anonymous counting and discards its visitor session identifier after approximately 24 hours. Google Analytics is configured separately by Google and should be set to its shortest available event-data retention period. Naya Aasha does not use analytics to identify visitors, sell analytics data, or create advertising profiles. Routine analytics reports are reviewed for website improvement.</p>
    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>Google Translate is loaded when translation features are used and may process page content according to Google’s terms. Web3Forms processes information submitted through the contact form so it can be delivered to Naya Aasha. GitHub authenticates authorized CMS administrators.</p>
    <h2>Security and access</h2>
    <p>The website uses HTTPS, restricted browser permissions, secure response headers, GitHub OAuth for CMS access, and limited administrative access. Security logs may be reviewed when necessary to investigate abuse, but they are not used to profile ordinary visitors.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p><button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button" data-cookie-settings>Open cookie settings</button></p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about privacy can be sent to <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${policies.complaintsEmail}`}>{policies.complaintsEmail}</a>.</p>
    <p class="notice">This policy should be reviewed periodically against Naya Aasha’s actual operations and Nepal’s applicable legal requirements.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
